  "releaseNotes": "Added signed point-distance contracts for contours and regions, region signed-distance rasterization updates, and degree-based Arc helpers. Added normalized RGBA8/RGBA16 color blending helpers and a shared temperature heat map palette used by influence-field heat map rasterization. Expanded color, contour, region, rectangle, culling-map, and heat map test coverage with refreshed approved snapshots. Reorganized Spatial2D documentation around concepts, geometry, regions, fields, rasterization, sampling, partitioning, recipes, performance, and testing with reproducible visual assets.",
